      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "fire"
      ],
      "text": "When the sun mage is destroyed, they explode in a blast of flame that deals 6d6 fire damage in a 10-foot emanation (DC 27 basic Reflex save save). Creatures that critically fail their saves are marked with Walkena's religious symbol on a visible area of their body, which remains for 1 day. This mark allows Walkena to treat the creature as if he knew the creature's identity but not having met them for the purposes of Scrying, lowering the spell's DC by 2. The sun mage's gear and treasure are unaffected by the explosion and left in a pile where they die."
