      "name": "Revitalizing Flame",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "healing"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\nEffect The sun mage produces a specialized flame that burns away maladies and restores a creature. If the sun mage's next action is to Cast a Spell with the fire trait that deals damage and isn't a cantrip, the spell doesn't deal any damage. It instead restores a number of Hit Points equal to four times the spell's rank to all targets or creatures. This restoration affects all creatures regardless of whether they are healed by vitality or void energy.",
